  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Discharges Causing Uncleanness",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses and Aaron,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Speak to the Israelites and say to them: 'When any man has an unusual bodily discharge, such a discharge is unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whether it continues flowing from his body or is blocked, it will make him unclean. This is how his discharge will bring about uncleanness:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Any bed the man with a discharge lies on will be unclean, and anything he sits on will be unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who touches his bed must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever sits on anything that the man with a discharge sat on must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Whoever touches the man who has a discharge must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'If the man with the discharge spits on anyone who is clean, they must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Everything the man sits on when riding will be unclean,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and whoever touches any of the things that were under him will be unclean till evening; whoever picks up those things must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Anyone the man with a discharge touches without rinsing his hands with water must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'A clay pot that the man touches must be broken, and any wooden article is to be rinsed with water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'When a man is cleansed from his discharge, he is to count off seven days for his ceremonial cleansing; he must wash his clothes and bathe himself with fresh water, and he will be clean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the eighth day he must take two doves or two young pigeons and come before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the entrance to the tent of meeting and give them to the priest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to sacrifice them, the one for a sin offering",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and the other for a burnt offering. In this way he will make atonement before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the man because of his discharge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'When a man has an emission of semen, he must bathe his whole body with water, and he will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any clothing or leather that has semen on it must be washed with water, and it will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When a man has sexual relations with a woman and there is an emission of semen, both of them must bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'When a woman has her regular flow of blood, the impurity of her monthly period will last seven days, and anyone who touches her will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Anything she lies on during her period will be unclean, and anything she sits on will be unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who touches her bed will be unclean; they must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who touches anything she sits on will be unclean; they must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whether it is the bed or anything she was sitting on, when anyone touches it, they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'If a man has sexual relations with her and her monthly flow touches him, he will be unclean for seven days; any bed he lies on will be unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'When a woman has a discharge of blood for many days at a time other than her monthly period or has a discharge that continues beyond her period, she will be unclean as long as she has the discharge, just as in the days of her period.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any bed she lies on while her discharge continues will be unclean, as is her bed during her monthly period, and anything she sits on will be unclean, as during her period.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who touches them will be unclean; they must wash their clothes and bathe with water, and they will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'When she is cleansed from her discharge, she must count off seven days, and after that she will be ceremonially clean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the eighth day she must take two doves or two young pigeons and bring them to the priest at the entrance to the tent of meeting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to sacrifice one for a sin offering and the other for a burnt offering. In this way he will make atonement for her before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.15.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the uncleanness of her discharge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
